Ques8: Explain the working principle and application of the following sensors ?
Sensor                    : IMU
         Purpose                 : Measures movement
         Working Principle : Uses accelerometer + gyroscope
         Application            : Keep drone stable
Sensor                    : Accelerometer
         Purpose                 : Detects tilt
         Working Principle : Measures acceleration
         Application            : Balancing the drone
 Sensor                   : Gyroscope
         Purpose                 : Detects rotation
         Working Principle : Measures angular movement
         Application            : Controls roll, pitch & yaw
 Sensor                   : Magnetometer
         Purpose                 :  Finds directions   
         Working Principle : Detects Earth’s magnetic field
         Application            : Navigation
 Sensor                   : Barometer
         Purpose                 :  Measures altitude
         Working Principle :  Measures air pressure
         Application            : Height control
 Sensor                   : GPS
         Purpose                 : Finds location
         Working Principle : Uses satellite signals
         Application            : Navigation & Return to Home
Sensor                    : Optical Flow Sensor  
         Purpose                 :  Detects ground movement 
         Working Principle :  Uses camera
         Application            : Indoor hovering
 Sensor                   : Ultrasonic Sensor
         Purpose                 :  Measures distance  
         Working Principle :  Uses sound waves
         Application            : Obstacle detection
 Sensor                    :LiDAR
         Purpose                 : Measures distance
         Working Principle : Uses laser beams
         Application            : 3D mapping
 Sensor              :  Camera 
         Purpose                 : Captures images
         Working Principle : Records photos/videos
         Application            : Photography & surveillance
